# Find maps with healing statues (object id 0x37D): boot, save Jian's room, then pin-warp to each map and dump
# the object table. Vanilla ROM. Saves state room.
include boot_to_field
wait 30
save room
load room
wait 5
pin u16 0x020B77EC 0
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
dump 0x020B6FD4 0x800 objects
load room
wait 5
pin u16 0x020B77EC 1
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
dump 0x020B6FD4 0x800 objects
